### List courses
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses

### Create a course; copy the returned id into the requests below
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Spring Boot REST Basics",
  "description": "Learn controllers, HTTP methods, and JSON storage",
  "target_date": "2026-12-31",
  "status": "Not Started"
}

### Get a course
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/{{courseId}}

### Replace all editable fields
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/courses/{{courseId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Spring Boot REST Basics",
  "description": "Practice CRUD endpoints",
  "target_date": "2026-12-31",
  "status": "In Progress"
}

### Delete a course
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/courses/{{courseId}}
